lexical.evidence_text:
To be eligible to enter and compete in the Championship , each Driver must:

Have had their Registration Application Form unconditionally accepted by PCA;

Be registered with the CM ;

Be at least seventeen (17) years of age;

Hold a minimum of a valid Motorsport Australia Circuit Licence without Provisional endorsement or equivalent, and;

Complete an online assessment to the satisfaction of the CM .

NOTE: A Driver holding a Licence issued by an ASN other than Motorsport Australia will be eligible to score points in the Championship.

